amendments.how:
frontend/libs/ui/README.md §6.12 gained one paragraph covering:
- a Sheet or Dialog opened while another is up renders inside that one's modal, and screens keep them as siblings, never nested or swapped by hand;
- the lower overlay's modal stays up without its panel, and back closes the top layer first;
- no route-scoped context in an overlay body (including under the shell's More or tenant sheet);
- no layer motion;
- the RupeeInput pad is not a kit overlay and chains only from inside a presented Sheet or Dialog, so never open one while a page-level pad is up;
- the web renderer is unchanged.

